WEBVTT

00:01:47.970 --> 00:01:53.120
I see now. Both Seira and Hippo had the same desire to see someone.

00:01:55.380 --> 00:01:56.840
The Healing Song

00:02:05.370 --> 00:02:10.100
The sound of{ the} ice hitting the glass is cool and refreshing.

00:02:10.100 --> 00:02:12.450
It really feels like summer.

00:02:12.450 --> 00:02:16.130
It feels like summer, huh? That's exactly the problem.

00:02:16.680 --> 00:02:19.780
What do you mean, Hanon?

00:02:19.780 --> 00:02:25.860
Well, it's finally summer vacation, but we haven't gone out on any dates.

00:02:25.860 --> 00:02:28.530
This totally doesn't feel like summer.

00:02:28.740 --> 00:02:31.400
Even if you say that, it still is' summertime.

00:02:28.740 --> 00:02:31.400
Even if you say that, it still is' summertime.

00:02:31.400 --> 00:02:36.600
In addition, Hanon, didn't you go on a date with Nagisa-kun for Celebration Night?

00:02:36.600 --> 00:02:41.570
Ahh! That little "excursion" with that little kid doesn't count as a date!

00:02:42.950 --> 00:02:45.100
Isn't there anything fun to do?

00:02:45.840 --> 00:02:46.680
Taki-san.

00:02:46.680 --> 00:02:52.640
What is it with you young girls? You're moping around inside when you could be planning to go outside.

00:02:52.640 --> 00:02:54.600
This is such an embarrassment.

00:02:54.600 --> 00:02:58.320
I think I shall tell your fortunes.

00:02:58.460 --> 00:03:00.320
Uhh... no thanks.

00:03:00.870 --> 00:03:04.100
Taki-san, your fortunes haven't been accurate up to now.

00:03:04.630 --> 00:03:07.110
You're useless when we need you the most.

00:03:07.110 --> 00:03:09.720
The three of you don't understand.

00:03:09.720 --> 00:03:13.670
With fortune-telling, it isn't a matter of being accurate or not.

00:03:13.670 --> 00:03:18.230
The goal of fortune-telling is to understand the direction of your future. That's what's most important.

00:03:19.480 --> 00:03:21.170
Eh? They disappeared.

00:03:21.170 --> 00:03:23.050
The three of them went out.

00:03:27.190 --> 00:03:28.980
What happened here?

00:03:28.980 --> 00:03:32.440
How horrible! Who caused all this?

00:03:32.950 --> 00:03:34.380
Hurry and tend to their wounds!

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:34.890
Yes, sir!

00:03:45.030 --> 00:03:46.930
Who are you?

00:03:46.930 --> 00:03:49.000
How do you do, Dr. Somegorou?

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:50.740
I'm Sister Sheshe.

00:03:50.740 --> 00:03:52.370
I'm Sister Mimi.

00:03:52.370 --> 00:03:54.910
It is our honor to meet you.

00:03:55.080 --> 00:03:56.710
How true.

00:03:56.710 --> 00:03:59.750
Are you the cause of all this?

00:03:59.750 --> 00:04:02.820
Of course. This was done to lure you out here.

00:04:02.820 --> 00:04:04.000
What did you say?

00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:07.100
So, please come with us.

00:04:07.100 --> 00:04:10.820
Mikeru-sama said that he needs your abilities.

00:04:18.870 --> 00:04:22.070
Ah, the weather is nice today.

00:04:22.070 --> 00:04:24.270
The sea breeze feels wonderful.

00:04:24.640 --> 00:04:26.790
But it's also boring.

00:04:26.790 --> 00:04:30.300
What are you saying, Lucia? You feel this is boring?

00:04:30.300 --> 00:04:32.160
It's the pot calling the kettle black.

00:04:32.730 --> 00:04:36.810
By the way, where did Karen, Noelle, and Coco go?

00:04:36.810 --> 00:04:41.630
I think Karen bought a book called "Choosing the Top 50 Okonomiyaki Stalls."

00:04:41.970 --> 00:04:43.890
She took a trip to try them all.

00:04:44.390 --> 00:04:49.820
Noelle is probably at the library to read some well known detective novels.

00:04:50.010 --> 00:04:55.110
Coco must be somewhere with a lot of men.

00:04:55.110 --> 00:04:57.270
Coco can't live without them{ doing that}.

00:04:57.270 --> 00:04:58.020
That's right.

00:04:58.020 --> 00:04:59.920
Eh? What's that?

00:05:04.390 --> 00:05:06.820
What is that? It looks like a pillbox.

00:05:06.820 --> 00:05:08.420
Something seems to be engraved on it.

00:05:08.620 --> 00:05:11.700
This is the emblem of the King of Squids.

00:05:12.160 --> 00:05:14.860
So does anyone know what this emblem means?

00:05:15.250 --> 00:05:17.000
I don't know.

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:19.500
I'm sorry, but I don't know either.

00:05:19.500 --> 00:05:25.530
However, I don't think it's a coincidence that it appeared right around the Pearl Piari.

00:05:25.530 --> 00:05:26.780
What is it?

00:05:27.190 --> 00:05:28.640
Ah, Taki-san.

00:05:28.640 --> 00:05:31.350
We picked up this pillbox on the beach.

00:05:31.350 --> 00:05:32.540
You picked this up on the beach?

00:05:33.660 --> 00:05:34.700
This is...

00:05:36.160 --> 00:05:39.250
Taki-san, do you know anything about this pillbox?

00:05:39.470 --> 00:05:45.330
Yeah. This is my medicine. An old friend sends it to me each month.

00:05:45.330 --> 00:05:47.570
But this is rather unusual.

00:05:47.570 --> 00:05:50.660
He normally delivers it to me in person.

00:05:50.660 --> 00:05:52.750
Taki-san, who is this old friend?

00:05:53.240 --> 00:05:55.630
He's called Somegorou.

00:05:55.630 --> 00:06:00.840
Oh! He's the most famous physician in the sea, and he's the ruler of the Kingdom of Squids.

00:06:00.840 --> 00:06:01.900
Yeah.

00:06:01.900 --> 00:06:04.640
And he delivers medicine every month...

00:06:04.640 --> 00:06:07.580
You're not unwell, are you?

00:06:07.580 --> 00:06:11.420
Oh no. It's not like that. You all don't have to worry about me.

00:06:13.390 --> 00:06:16.140
But it's a pretty pillbox.

00:06:16.940 --> 00:06:18.580
Ahh!

00:06:21.380 --> 00:06:23.130
What in the world is this?

00:06:23.130 --> 00:06:26.860
Ahh! Hanon, you've become an old lady!

00:06:26.860 --> 00:06:28.450
Hanon, your hair...

00:06:28.450 --> 00:06:31.270
Eh? What's wrong with my hair?

00:06:34.710 --> 00:06:40.230
Ahhhh!

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:38.680
Calm down, Hanon.

00:06:38.680 --> 00:06:40.100
You were merely covered by white powder.

00:06:40.230 --> 00:06:42.210
Ahh, that was scary!

00:06:42.210 --> 00:06:45.100
Is this a pillbox or a powderbox?

00:06:46.350 --> 00:06:48.480
You shouldn't have to worry about it.

00:06:48.890 --> 00:06:51.570
If it's not mixed with water, it has no effect.

00:06:55.050 --> 00:06:56.590
Taki-san, what is it?

00:06:57.140 --> 00:07:00.400
There's a letter from Somegorou in the pillbox.

00:07:00.900 --> 00:07:01.950
A letter?

00:07:01.950 --> 00:07:06.640
Apparently the Kingdom of Squids has been attacked.

00:07:07.580 --> 00:07:09.160
The Kingdom of Squids?

00:07:09.160 --> 00:07:12.000
Could it be Mikeru's doing?

00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:13.510
It has to be.

00:07:14.110 --> 00:07:15.860
I think so, too.

00:07:15.860 --> 00:07:19.100
But why are they attacking the Kingdom of Squids?

00:07:23.960 --> 00:07:26.380
What do you intend to do with me?

00:07:26.380 --> 00:07:27.520
I don't know.

00:07:27.520 --> 00:07:32.090
We're only following Mikeru-sama's orders.

00:07:32.090 --> 00:07:32.930
Mikeru?

00:07:34.770 --> 00:07:38.080
Hmm. So you're Dr. Somegorou, huh?

00:07:38.080 --> 00:07:42.110
Okay then. Please hand over the powder that you have.

00:07:42.800 --> 00:07:43.770
Powder?

00:07:44.420 --> 00:07:46.200
What are you talking about?

00:07:46.200 --> 00:07:47.880
Don't pretend to be ignorant!{Don't you feign ignorance!}

00:07:47.880 --> 00:07:50.110
I've throughly investigated your abilities.

00:07:50.750 --> 00:07:53.390
That powder is a double-edged sword.

00:07:53.390 --> 00:07:57.290
Only citizens of the Kingdom of Squids are able to use it.

00:07:57.800 --> 00:07:59.750
What powder are they talking about?

00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:01.040
Who knows?

00:08:01.040 --> 00:08:03.400
Hurry up and give me that powder!

00:08:03.790 --> 00:08:07.970
If you don't, who knows which kingdom will be attacked next?

00:08:08.480 --> 00:08:09.730
Now, give it to me!

00:08:10.100 --> 00:08:13.910
I have no choice. Take it!

00:08:13.910 --> 00:08:17.350
If only you'd handed it over when we asked the first time.

00:08:17.350 --> 00:08:18.910
How true.

00:08:18.910 --> 00:08:20.870
We'll take that.

00:08:20.870 --> 00:08:22.510
What are you planning to do?

00:08:23.060 --> 00:08:25.880
How dare you do this to the Kingdom of Squids!

00:08:25.880 --> 00:08:27.900
We'll never forgive you!

00:08:27.900 --> 00:08:30.980
Ah, it's the Mermaid Princesses.

00:08:30.980 --> 00:08:34.920
How fortunate. We were able to lure in the Mermaid Princesses.

00:08:34.920 --> 00:08:36.230
How true!

00:08:40.630 --> 00:08:41.840
We got it back!

00:08:41.840 --> 00:08:42.690
We did it!

00:08:44.440 --> 00:08:45.290
Oh no!

00:08:47.030 --> 00:08:48.440
It's that powder again!

00:08:48.610 --> 00:08:52.840
Eh!? If the powder is misused...

00:08:52.840 --> 00:08:54.870
...you'll age really quickly?

00:08:54.870 --> 00:09:00.900
Yeah. It's capable of turning a vital life force into a weak life force.

00:09:00.900 --> 00:09:04.120
If it's not applied correctly, it'll cause cells to mature faster.

00:09:05.040 --> 00:09:07.730
I wonder if Lucia-san and the others are okay.

00:09:15.600 --> 00:09:17.900
What's going on!?

00:09:17.900 --> 00:09:22.780
Isn't your powder supposed to increase the life force of beings?

00:09:22.690 --> 00:09:25.040
That's why I said from the beginning that it's a doubled-edged sword.

00:09:25.470 --> 00:09:31.720
If this powder is misused, it will cause accelerated maturation of cells.

00:09:31.720 --> 00:09:34.020
So then, we've...

00:09:34.020 --> 00:09:38.510
...really become old ladies this time.

00:09:38.510 --> 00:09:41.190
It seems that way.

00:09:41.700 --> 00:09:45.530
Who would have thought that the Mermaid Princesses would become old hags?

00:09:45.530 --> 00:09:47.090
How true.

00:09:47.090 --> 00:09:50.000
So does this mean that you can't sing the songs that you really like?

00:09:50.000 --> 00:09:52.800
You're no match for us!

00:09:52.800 --> 00:09:54.600
Oh no!

00:09:54.900 --> 00:09:57.670
We can't sing any more?

00:09:57.670 --> 00:09:59.580
I don't believe you.

00:09:59.860 --> 00:10:03.650
Now do you all understand how dangerous the powder can be!?

00:10:03.840 --> 00:10:09.340
But if it's used correctly, this powder is still something that Mikeru-sama wants.

00:10:09.340 --> 00:10:11.250
Am I right, Doctor?

00:10:12.910 --> 00:10:17.230
On a side note, it looks like we're going to be bringing back lots of gifts.

00:10:17.230 --> 00:10:18.140
Eh?

00:10:18.470 --> 00:10:21.230
This is really bad.

00:10:21.230 --> 00:10:25.100
Lucia! Hanon! Let's get out of here.

00:10:25.100 --> 00:10:27.440
Yeah. Heave ho!

00:10:27.960 --> 00:10:32.430
You're moving so slowly. Do you intend to escape from us like that?

00:10:32.430 --> 00:10:33.880
How true.

00:10:34.290 --> 00:10:35.950
It's Show Time!

00:11:44.650 --> 00:11:45.830
Hippo!

00:11:45.830 --> 00:11:47.080
You saved us!

00:11:47.520 --> 00:11:49.520
Everyone! Now's our chance!

00:11:53.510 --> 00:11:55.950
Presented by Licca and Wasurenai-Fansubs

00:12:03.410 --> 00:12:05.200
I'm sorry, Taki-san.

00:12:05.500 --> 00:12:08.210
We couldn't save Somegorou-san.

00:12:08.210 --> 00:12:13.670
It's fine. I didn't explain everything to you about that powder.

00:12:13.670 --> 00:12:14.850
Sorry about that.

00:12:14.850 --> 00:12:17.190
And now your bodies have changed into this.

00:12:17.190 --> 00:12:21.760
Hey, Taki-san. Is there a way to return our bodies to normal?

00:12:21.760 --> 00:12:25.440
Yeah. You just need Somegorou's ink to return to normal.

00:12:25.440 --> 00:12:28.860
We can use Somegorou-san's ink to return to our normal selves?

00:12:28.860 --> 00:12:34.530
Yep. You just need to shine a strong light on Somegorou in order to get him to secrete his ink.

00:12:35.070 --> 00:12:41.460
The King of Squids will secrete ink when you shine a strong light on him.

00:12:41.460 --> 00:12:47.710
So Taki-san, all we need to do is find Somegorou again, then shine a strong light on him, right?

00:12:47.710 --> 00:12:50.330
Yeah. Doing that would cause everyone to return to normal.

00:12:50.720 --> 00:12:54.290
All right! This time we're really going to beat them down!

00:13:00.860 --> 00:13:03.120
The sunset is pretty.

00:13:03.120 --> 00:13:06.270
It's still looks the same as yesterday's sunset.

00:13:06.270 --> 00:13:08.670
Hey, Hanon, Rina.

00:13:09.340 --> 00:13:14.580
Even though we've become old ladies, we'll always be good friends.

00:13:14.580 --> 00:13:17.230
Having friends for tea and gossip doesn't sound bad.

00:13:23.370 --> 00:13:24.650
Hey, Taki-san.

00:13:24.650 --> 00:13:25.080
Hmm?

00:13:25.760 --> 00:13:27.350
May I ask you something?

00:13:27.350 --> 00:13:28.180
What is it?

00:13:28.180 --> 00:13:32.020
You described a method to have Somegorou-san secrete his ink.

00:13:32.460 --> 00:13:35.760
But wouldn't he...

00:13:35.760 --> 00:13:39.020
You figured it out, didn't you?

00:13:39.660 --> 00:13:41.880
My fortunes are the most accurate under these conditions.

00:13:42.680 --> 00:13:45.670
In his heart, he wishes to do this.

00:13:46.200 --> 00:13:49.110
He's willing to sacrifice his own life, no matter the cost.

00:13:49.110 --> 00:13:50.430
How could that be?

00:13:54.580 --> 00:13:55.880
Somegorou-san.

00:13:56.520 --> 00:13:58.490
Mermaid Princesses-sama!

00:13:58.490 --> 00:14:05.020
We're here for your ink so our bodies can be restored to normal.

00:14:05.350 --> 00:14:08.110
Then you need to hurry and shine that light on me!

00:14:08.440 --> 00:14:12.080
But we have to save you first.

00:14:12.490 --> 00:14:15.730
Don't worry about me! Hurry and shine the light on me!

00:14:16.100 --> 00:14:17.700
Do it before they come back!

00:14:18.580 --> 00:14:19.800
I understand.

00:14:19.800 --> 00:14:23.000
It's pretty bright, but I'm going to start.

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:24.240
Wait!

00:14:24.840 --> 00:14:25.810
Hippo!

00:14:25.810 --> 00:14:27.080
What's wrong?

00:14:27.170 --> 00:14:33.670
If Somegorou-san secretes his ink, he'll lose his life!

00:14:34.510 --> 00:14:37.670
Somegorou-san, is that true?

00:14:37.670 --> 00:14:43.790
If I can restore your bodies to what they were, my life doesn't matter.

00:14:44.010 --> 00:14:47.540
So hurry and shine that light on me before they come back!

00:14:47.540 --> 00:14:49.730
B-But...

00:14:49.730 --> 00:14:53.860
So you finally showed up, Mermaid Princesses-sama.

00:14:53.860 --> 00:14:54.650
Sheshe!

00:14:54.650 --> 00:14:55.330
Mimi!

00:14:55.330 --> 00:14:56.170
Oh no!{Shit!}

00:14:56.660 --> 00:14:59.910
I figured that you wouldn't be willing to see Dr. Somegorou get killed.

00:14:59.910 --> 00:15:01.560
We've been waiting nearby for quite some time.

00:15:01.560 --> 00:15:07.090
And with that, the Mermaid Princesses will also become our gifts today.

00:15:07.090 --> 00:15:10.570
With those bodies, you can't properly sing.

00:15:10.570 --> 00:15:12.020
How true.

00:15:12.020 --> 00:15:14.520
You'll run out of breath and faint halfway through whatever you're singing.{You'll be singing and you'll faint after you run out of breath halfway though.}

00:15:15.930 --> 00:15:17.530
Lucia, Hanon! We're going to sing!

00:15:18.670 --> 00:15:25.470
You may have taken away our youth, but you didn't take away our heart!

00:15:25.470 --> 00:15:27.760
W-What are you saying?

00:15:27.870 --> 00:15:29.280
You're a bunch of idiots!

00:15:29.280 --> 00:15:34.910
Even if our bodies are old, our hearts are still the same!

00:15:47.020 --> 00:15:49.100
Pink Pearl Voice!

00:15:50.690 --> 00:15:52.820
Aqua Pearl Voice!

00:15:54.970 --> 00:15:57.130
Green Pearl Voice!

00:15:58.780 --> 00:16:01.510
Pichi Pichi Voice Live Start!

00:16:23.130 --> 00:16:27.200
What's with this song!? It resonates in my heart!

00:16:27.200 --> 00:16:31.820
Sister Sheshe! My heart hurts! Why!?

00:17:04.120 --> 00:17:06.530
They can still sing and dance even when they're so old!

00:17:06.530 --> 00:17:08.340
What's going on!?

00:17:08.590 --> 00:17:12.000
Love Shower Pitch!

00:17:13.540 --> 00:17:15.380
How about an encore?

00:17:16.110 --> 00:17:17.830
Give me a break!

00:17:17.830 --> 00:17:21.240
They're still this powerful even when they're that' old!

00:17:17.830 --> 00:17:21.240
They're still this powerful even when they're that' old!

00:17:22.900 --> 00:17:24.400
Yay!

00:17:24.960 --> 00:17:25.790
Ahh!

00:17:25.790 --> 00:17:27.290
Somegorou-san is...

00:17:29.730 --> 00:17:31.700
What are you doing, Somegorou-san!?

00:17:40.380 --> 00:17:41.580
Yay!

00:17:41.580 --> 00:17:43.940
We're back to our young selves!

00:17:43.940 --> 00:17:45.210
What about Somegorou-san?

00:17:45.210 --> 00:17:47.380
Somegorou-san! Hang in there!

00:17:47.580 --> 00:17:49.200
Please don't die!

00:17:49.200 --> 00:17:51.280
Please open your eyes!

00:17:51.280 --> 00:17:52.560
Somegorou-san!

00:17:53.770 --> 00:17:56.110
Mermaid Princesses-sama.

00:17:56.110 --> 00:17:59.640
Please continue to sing your songs of healing.

00:18:01.560 --> 00:18:02.880
How could this be?

00:18:02.880 --> 00:18:04.740
I don't want this!

00:18:04.740 --> 00:18:05.740
Doctor!

00:18:05.740 --> 00:18:07.340
How could this happen to him?

00:18:07.340 --> 00:18:08.130
Hippo!

00:18:08.460 --> 00:18:10.960
As a matter of fact, I heard from Nikora-san.

00:18:10.960 --> 00:18:13.830
Somegorou-san is Taki-san's fiancé.

00:18:13.830 --> 00:18:17.910
They were going to get married when the seas become peaceful again.

00:18:18.800 --> 00:18:20.310
H-How did this happen?

00:18:21.230 --> 00:18:22.550
Why did this happen?

00:18:23.150 --> 00:18:24.400
Somegorou-san.

00:18:25.830 --> 00:18:27.020
We're going to sing.

00:18:27.220 --> 00:18:28.310
Lucia.

00:18:28.310 --> 00:18:31.140
We're going to sing a song of healing for Somegorou-san's sake.

00:18:47.850 --> 00:18:49.630
Pink Pearl Voice!

00:18:53.010 --> 00:18:54.880
Aqua Pearl Voice!

00:18:57.440 --> 00:18:59.120
Green Pearl Voice!

00:21:06.370 --> 00:21:07.560
Somegorou-san!

00:21:07.560 --> 00:21:13.550
Ah, I heard the song of the Mermaid Princesses from in my heart.

00:21:13.730 --> 00:21:15.100
I'm glad!

00:21:15.660 --> 00:21:16.990
Thank goodness!

00:21:16.990 --> 00:21:18.870
I'm glad!

00:21:18.870 --> 00:21:22.450
Somegorou-san, let's take you to see Taki-san!

00:21:22.960 --> 00:21:24.700
I'll stay here.

00:21:24.700 --> 00:21:25.540
Eh?

00:21:25.540 --> 00:21:26.930
Why are you staying here!?

00:21:27.460 --> 00:21:30.170
I've already promised her.

00:21:30.170 --> 00:21:35.920
Until the day the seas are peaceful again, I'll continue to protect them.

00:21:43.560 --> 00:21:46.580
I see. So he's safe.

00:21:46.580 --> 00:21:49.220
Yeah. He told us to give you his regards.

00:21:49.220 --> 00:21:51.720
He'll wait for your return.

00:21:52.900 --> 00:21:57.480
Then I need to maintain my health and youth.

00:21:57.480 --> 00:21:59.310
Taki-san, that medicine is...

00:22:00.230 --> 00:22:04.650
Until I see him again, I'll use this to maintain my skin.

00:22:04.650 --> 00:22:09.310
By the way, Taki-san. I've been meaning to ask you, but how old are you?

00:22:10.170 --> 00:22:13.810
Who knows? I lost count a long time ago.

00:22:13.810 --> 00:22:15.780
You lost count a long time ago...{You forgot it a long time ago...}

00:22:15.780 --> 00:22:18.420
That's because the heart will never age.

00:23:51.040 --> 00:23:52.100
I love you.

00:23:52.100 --> 00:23:54.080
It's the first time I've felt something like this.

00:23:54.080 --> 00:23:58.420
It sometimes hurts when you feel that you love someone.

00:23:58.420 --> 00:24:00.430
I keep noticing you. I can't help it.

00:24:00.430 --> 00:24:03.090
Then notice me. It makes me happy.

00:24:03.460 --> 00:24:06.120
Don't you feel these kinds of thoughts are strange?

00:24:06.120 --> 00:24:07.360
Of course not!

00:24:08.150 --> 00:24:10.090
I... I also...

00:24:10.090 --> 00:24:11.760
I really love you!

00:24:11.760 --> 00:24:14.960
Next time on Mermaid Melody Pichi Pichi Pitch Pure:

00:24:14.960 --> 00:24:16.560
Love Detective.

00:24:16.560 --> 00:24:18.900
But what about Rina?
